KikasaTalismanLin: {
	DisplayName: Fine Rain Talisman
	Tooltip: Faster rain beats; prolonged rain enters 'Steady Rain' for denser drizzle; single ink drop damage -6%
	Origin:
		'''
		Old craftsmen in oilpaper umbrella shops often say that two unbroken weeks of plum rains wear the soul down hardest.
		Drizzle falls fine as ox-hair, seemingly feeble and silent against the roof tiles,
		yet ceiling beams and hidden pillars have long rotted through with damp.
		This talisman records that relentless, bone-chilling seepage:
		the longer the rain falls, the denser it weaves.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Fine Rain': ink rain cadence accelerated by 20%
		continuous rainfall for 10s gathers into the 'Steady Rain' state:
		a dense curtain of drizzle pours beneath the canopy, speeding cadence by an additional 10%
		stopping or stowing the umbrella decays the downpour rapidly.
		'''
	Burden: Single ink drop damage reduced by 6%
}

KikasaTalismanLao: {
	DisplayName: Ink Puddle Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink drops always form large puddles on landing, absorbing rain to surge outward upon overflowing; single drop damage -5%
	Origin:
		'''
		The blueflag pavers of old thoroughfares are worn and rutted;
		the murky dead water pooled in stone hollows never dries, even through three months of drought.
		Beneath lies rotting silt and suffocating leaf-muck hidden from sunlight;
		passersby treat it as a shallow puddle until a misstep sinks their boot hopelessly into the pit.
		Steeped in stagnant dead water, rain gathers into puddles and overflows in surges.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Pooling': ink drops always gather into puddles on impact,
		extending puddle duration by 50% and radius by 30%
		drops landing in existing puddles raise the water level,
		absorbing three drops before overflowing into surges on both sides,
		dealing 50% puddle damage each.
		'''
	Burden: Single ink drop damage reduced by 5%
}

KikasaTalismanPei: {
	DisplayName: Downpour Talisman
	Tooltip: Faster inverted charge rate and stronger ink geysers, detonating an explosive shockwave at the source upon full charge; normal rain cadence -8%
	Origin:
		'''
		Before a flash flood breaks loose, mountain brooks mysteriously run bone-dry,
		dammed up by fallen trunks and dead boulders at the gorge above.
		Once the rising head of water smashes through the weir,
		the entire valley is swallowed by crashing mud and unstoppable fury.
		This talisman holds the deluge tightly pent within the canopy:
		holding back until the gates breach in a torrential burst.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Downpour': inverted charge rate increased by 35%, ink geyser damage increased by 20%
		unleashing a full-charge torrent detonates an area shockwave at the source,
		dealing 80% torrent damage and greatly widening the deluge.
		'''
	Burden: Standard ink rain cadence slowed by 8%
}

KikasaTalismanSha: {
	DisplayName: Swift Rain Talisman
	Tooltip: Opens umbrella near-instantly, first beat fires three consecutive drops; interval after the volley extended by 40%
	Origin:
		'''
		Midsummer afternoon squalls strike with the fiercest malice;
		one moment the blazing sun bakes the roof tiles scorching hot,
		The next, howling winds drive down coin-sized raindrops headlong,
		leaving fleeing wanderers no time to take three paces.
		This talisman harnesses that explosive opening fury as the canopy snaps open.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Swift Rain': umbrella opening deployment time reduced by 75%
		the very first beat after opening guarantees three consecutive swift raindrops,
		each dealing 75% of basic drop damage.
		'''
	Burden: After triggering the opening triple-volley, the attack interval to the next beat is extended by 40%
}

KikasaTalismanYin: {
	DisplayName: Ink Bloom Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink drop hits stack bleeding ink marks, detonating for massive damage at five stacks; single drop damage -8%
	Origin:
		'''
		If a droplet of pitch-black ink accidentally spatters onto finished cloth in a dye-house,
		rubbing it with a damp rag only drives the pigment deeper along the fibers, rotting into a festering stain.
		This talisman borrows that burrowing tenacity:
		ink marks bite layer upon layer into flesh wounds, piling heavier until the flesh bursts open.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Ink Bloom': ink drop hits leave bleeding ink marks (stacks up to 5, dealing continuous bleed damage based on stacks)
		at 5 stacks the ink blooms, detonating for 160% drop damage in an area and clearing all stacks.
		'''
	Burden: Single ink drop damage reduced by 8%
}

KikasaTalismanLu: {
	DisplayName: Sweet Dew Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink drops occasionally condense pure dewdrops on hit, restoring life when gathered; ink rain cadence slowed by 6%
	Origin:
		'''
		Itinerant village doctors walking night roads always carried a bamboo phial,
		sweeping morning dew from grass tips to blend with dried herbs on weeping ulcers.
		This talisman purges foul malice from black water, condensing a few beads of sweet herbal dew;
		though it slows the downpour, it preserves life in dire straits.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Sweet Dew': ink drops have a 12% chance on hit to condense a pure dewdrop on the ground,
		restoring 2 life when gathered (at most 3 afield).
		'''
	Burden: Ink rain cadence slowed by 6%
}

KikasaTalismanFei: {
	DisplayName: Lingering Mist Talisman
	Tooltip: Every third ink drop bursts into cold fog, damaging and slowing enemies within; mist drop direct damage -30%
	Origin:
		'''
		At river ferries in late autumn, vapors hang thick as wet batting;
		three paces out, the mooring lines vanish into gray haze, forcing seasoned boatmen to drop anchor.
		This talisman shatters every third drop into pervasive wet mist that refuses to disperse,
		blinding eyes and miring footsteps.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Lingering Mist': every third ink drop becomes a mist droplet:
		leaves a 2-second ink fog on hit, dealing continuous damage to enemies within and reducing
		their movement speed by 10%.
		'''
	Burden: Mist droplet direct hit damage reduced by 30%
}

KikasaTalismanXian: {
	DisplayName: Scattering Pearls Talisman
	Tooltip: Heavy ink drops shatter into five bouncing pearls on impact; formed puddle radius -15%
	Origin:
		'''
		Beneath old eaves sits a greenstone cistern; during downpours,
		water crashing from the roof rafters shatters into leaping spray,
		pitting the stone rim with countless tiny craters.
		This talisman gathers heavy rains only to shatter them into bounding stars,
		ricocheting and burrowing across the ground.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Scattering Pearls': heavy ink drops shatter on ground impact into 5 fine ink pearls,
		each dealing 30% of original drop damage and bouncing up to 2 additional times along the terrain.
		'''
	Burden: Formed puddle radius reduced by 15%
}

KikasaTalismanXi: {
	DisplayName: Tide Talisman
	Tooltip: Puddles hold tidal surges, actively lunging waves toward nearby foes on rain impacts; puddle duration -20%
	Origin:
		'''
		Mud burrows on tidal flats seem dead by day; yet once the deep tide surges against the outer reefs,
		the silt in the ditches rolls like serpents, lunging at anything that moves.
		This talisman infuses ocean undertows into surface puddles:
		no longer waiting for footsteps, falling rain spurs the dark water to snap forward.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Tide': puddles gain surging tidal cadence:
		when new drops land in existing puddles, the puddle surges a wave toward the nearest enemy,
		the crest dealing 50% puddle damage.
		'''
	Burden: Puddle ground duration reduced by 20%
}

KikasaTalismanZi: {
	DisplayName: Ink Soak Talisman
	Tooltip: Foes standing in puddles stack deepening damage vulnerability; puddle base continuous damage -25%
	Origin:
		'''
		An old dyer presses raw hemp into the vat; the deeper it steeps, the tighter the color takes hold,
		until stiff cords become sodden and frail to the pull.
		Creatures trapped in ink mire suffer the same fate:
		steep long enough, and the cold malice softens their bones, prying open every wound.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Ink Soak': enemies standing in puddles accumulate soak stacks (up to 8 stacks),
		each stack increasing all ink-type damage taken by 2.5%.
		'''
	Burden: Puddle base continuous damage reduced by 25%
}

KikasaTalismanTing: {
	DisplayName: Thunder Geyser Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink geysers erupt higher and chain lightning to nearby foes; inverted charge rate -13%
	Origin:
		'''
		Deep pools mid-river hide sunken thunder-veins;
		in howling storms as vapors rise, a rolling thunderclap striking black water blasts columns of lightning like boiling oil.
		This talisman channels lightning through water:
		geysers erupt skyward from the canopy, dragging along chains of tearing thunder.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Thunder Geyser': ink geyser height increased by 50%,
		chaining lightning to up to 2 nearby foes on hit (dealing 50% geyser damage each)
		uncharged cascades also have a 25% chance to stir a small thunder geyser on landing.
		'''
	Burden: Inverted charge rate reduced by 13%
}

KikasaTalismanHong: {
	DisplayName: Rainbow Bridge Talisman
	Tooltip: Torrent leaves an aerial rainbow bridge that buffs movement/summoning and burns crossing foes; torrent width -10%
	Origin:
		'''
		Over rain-washed mountain passes where mist steams upward,
		a spectral arch of a bridge often hangs in the sky.
		Seemingly fragile radiance, it is razor-sharp essence forged by storm and blazing sun:
		mortals borrow its light to tread lightly, while demons walking through enter an inferno.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Rainbow Bridge': after pouring a torrent,
		an aerial rainbow bridge forms over the landing zone for 5s:
		granting +10% movement speed and +10% summon damage underneath
		enemies crossing the arc suffer 40% torrent damage every 0.5s.
		'''
	Burden: Torrent hitbox width narrowed by 10%
}

KikasaTalismanHang: {
	DisplayName: Night Miasma Talisman
	Tooltip: Greatly increases ink damage at night and steams up toxic miasma plumes from puddles; day ink damage -5%
	Origin:
		'''
		Deep in swamplands, marshes seal themselves at nightfall;
		shallow pools that showed bare mud by day bubble with foul black froth past midnight.
		Old foragers would rather shiver on tree branches than set foot on soil;
		the cold miasma rising from night waters corrodes human lungs like rust.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Night Miasma': all ink damage increased by 15% at night,
		and puddles continuously steam up toxic miasma plumes
		(dealing 30% drop damage every 0.5s).
		'''
	Burden: All ink damage reduced by 5% during daytime
}

KikasaTalismanBao: {
	DisplayName: Hailstone Talisman
	Tooltip: Every fourth beat fires heavy armor-shattering hailstones with doubled damage and strong knockback; regular drop damage -8%
	Origin:
		'''
		In sweltering early summer, when skies turn black as pitch and grinding thunder rumbles like millstones
		overhead, the frozen core of heaven is about to fall.
		Fist-sized stones crashing from thousands of feet smash roof tiles and cattle to splinters;
		the talisman gathers bitter cold, pounding holes through flesh and bone.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Hailstone': every fourth beat guarantees a full volley,
		all drops turning into heavy hailstones:
		size +60%, damage +120%, tearing enemy defense with heavy knockback
		hailstones do not form puddles on impact.
		'''
	Burden: Standard ink drop damage outside hail beats reduced by 8%
}

KikasaTalismanShu: {
	DisplayName: Timely Rain Talisman
	Tooltip: Taking damage accelerates rain to a torrent for three seconds, healing on hit; regular rain interval +5%
	Origin:
		'''
		When parched plains yield no grain, a sudden cloudburst saves a county from ruin.
		Wandering umbrella peddlers stitch life-preserving wards into the deepest ribs;
		quiet in peacetime, the moment blood is drawn,
		golden rain pours from the canopy to pull a soul back from the brink.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Timely Rain': for 3 seconds after taking damage,
		ink rain interval is halved and rain turns golden,
		each hit restoring 1 life to the wielder (12-second cooldown).
		'''
	Burden: Standard rain firing interval extended by 5%
}

KikasaTalismanLong: {
	DisplayName: Scouring Falls Talisman
	Tooltip: Torrent turns into a raging rush that continuously repels foes; torrent duration -20%
	Origin:
		'''
		Through narrow stone gorges where two cliffs meet,
		summer flash floods crashing down with boulders and felled trees shake the precipices;
		the head of water snaps bridges and heaves rocks.
		Inverted, the canopy pours like a ruptured dam,
		driving even the most stubborn beasts away before its foaming crest.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Scouring Falls': torrent converts into a raging surge:
		continuously pushing enemies along the flow line,
		direct hits at the source knockback +35%.
		'''
	Burden: Torrent duration reduced by 20%
}

KikasaTalismanShuang: {
	DisplayName: Frost Mirror Talisman
	Tooltip: Puddles freeze into slowing frost mirrors; heavy drops shatter mirrors to erupt ice spikes; puddles cannot merge
	Origin:
		'''
		On midwinter mornings, shallow mud pools freeze into brittle sheets of clear ice;
		smooth as glass, footsteps slip and slide.
		When a heavy weight crashes through, jagged shards bite like daggers into flesh;
		ground frost turns to glass, shattered mirrors spit fangs.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Frost Mirror': heavy drops freeze into thin frost mirrors on landing:
		no longer dealing burn damage, enemies treading mirrors lose 40% movement speed
		subsequent drops striking mirrors shatter them instantly,
		dealing burst damage scaling with remaining lifespan and raising piercing ice spikes.
		'''
	Burden: Frost mirrors remain separate; puddles cannot merge through falling rain to extend duration
}

KikasaTalismanZha: {
	DisplayName: Rain Drum Talisman
	Tooltip: Landing hits on seven consecutive beats empowers the eighth beat to deal triple damage; rain pauses briefly after the heavy strike
	Origin:
		'''
		Old fishermen drum their skiffs to herd shoals,
		striking the gunwales seven times without breaking rhythm as currents pulse beneath.
		At the eighth hollow drumbeat, the fish leap from the river;
		this talisman tunes rain to a drumming rite, seven beats to bind the spirit, the eighth to shatter stone.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Rain Drum': seven drum marks gather along the rim:
		landing at least one drop on each of seven consecutive beats empowers all drops
		on the eighth beat to deal 3x damage
		missing a beat resets the count.
		'''
	Burden: After triggering the eighth-beat drum burst, rain pauses briefly for one beat
}

KikasaTalismanNi: {
	DisplayName: Tricolor Talisman
	Tooltip: Drops cycle through three aspects: red burst, blue slow, purple erosion; drop base damage -5%
	Origin:
		'''
		Waters in ancient well-springs shift with the seasons:
		clear water numbs sinew, reddish water boils like vinegar, deep purple water dissolves the soul like venom.
		The talismansmith drew a gourd from each of the three springs to grind ink,
		setting their currents into a mutual cycle of burst, bind, and rot.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Tricolor': rain drops cycle through three aspects:
		red drops trigger 40% area burst splash
		blue drops slow enemies by 15%
		purple drops increase all ink-type damage taken by 5%.
		'''
	Burden: Drop base damage reduced by 5%
}

KikasaTalismanWen: {
	DisplayName: Cloud Script Talisman
	Tooltip: Talisman stars on the rim charge on hits, launching homing ink arrows at full charge; rain interval +8%
	Origin:
		'''
		Wind-and-thunder seal-scripts chiseled into ruined temple steles wind like clouds,
		indecipherable to mortal eyes.
		An old mason traced rubbings onto oiled umbrella paper;
		as ink flowed through the glyphs, star-gleams clustered along the rim,
		condensing water into homing arrows of vengeance.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Cloud Script': three script-stars orbit the rim, charging on drop hits
		when fully charged the active star launches a homing ink arrow dealing 120% drop damage.
		'''
	Burden: Ink rain firing interval extended by 8%
}

KikasaTalismanPo: {
	DisplayName: Moonsoul Talisman
	Tooltip: Gathers moonlight while open at night, full charge turns the torrent into a vast pale moonfall; completely ineffective by day
	Origin:
		'''
		In windless mountain tarns under a frozen midnight moon, water glistens with pale phosphorescence,
		cold to the bone as fish sink to the silt, motionless.
		This talisman gathers that midnight chill into the canopy;
		unleashed, white light bursts like a blizzard of frost-daggers, yet vanishes before the morning sun.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Moonsoul': landing hits while open at night accumulates lunar phases
		when full, the next inverted pour becomes a pale moonfall:
		torrent area +50%, hits inflict moonbursts with 35% area splash damage.
		'''
	Burden: Completely ineffective during daytime, granting no benefits
}

KikasaTalismanXiao: {
	DisplayName: Nine Heavens Talisman
	Tooltip: Canopy ascends to great heights, high-altitude drops gain immense speed and damage; rain interval +10%
	Origin:
		'''
		From sheer mountain precipices, cascades plummet thousands of feet into the gorge,
		roaring like thunder and drilling clean through granite boulders.
		Lifting the umbrella's stance into the nine heavens, rain falls under crushing gravity,
		carrying the momentum to split cliffs and smash stone.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Nine Heavens': umbrella height is doubled, drops fall vertically from great heights:
		terminal velocity +40%, direct hit damage +25%,
		shadow rings telegraph impacts on the ground beforehand.
		'''
	Burden: Ink rain firing interval extended by 10%
}

KikasaTalismanMei: {
	DisplayName: Mold Rain Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink drops inflict stacking mold rot, dying victims burst into contagious spore clouds; drop direct damage -10%
	Origin:
		'''
		In sodden rainy months, trampled straw sandals sprout green mold within two nights, reeking with sweet, suffocating rot.
		Sealing that putrid damp into the talisman core, every drop spreads bone-softening mildew;
		when the host breathes their last, spores burst out to infect all nearby.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Mold Rain': drops inflict 'Mold Rot' on hit (stacks up to 10, dealing continuous damage based on stacks)
		afflicted enemies dying burst into spore clouds,
		passing half their stacks to nearby foes with light area damage.
		'''
	Burden: Drop direct hit damage reduced by 10%
}

KikasaTalismanPi: {
	DisplayName: Heavenly Thunder Talisman
	Tooltip: Short window after torrent pour allows drops to summon piercing lightning; geyser burst damage -20%
	Origin:
		'''
		When summer storms burst reservoir dykes, water floods three feet deep under a lid of black clouds,
		welcoming lightning dragons that strike water and ignite fire.
		The torrent paves a watercourse; as yin and yang collide in the clouds,
		every raindrop summons lightning down like a javelin.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Heavenly Thunder': pouring a torrent opens a 10-second lightning window:
		drops have a 20% chance on hit to call down direct lightning strikes,
		dealing 180% piercing damage along the bolt.
		'''
	Burden: Ink geyser burst damage reduced by 20%
}

KikasaTalismanXia: {
	DisplayName: Twilight Blaze Talisman
	Tooltip: Ink damage surges at dawn and dusk with burning twilight flames; damage reduced at noon and midnight by 6%
	Origin:
		'''
		At dawn and dusk when light and night trade hands,
		the horizon blazes with blood-red clouds as water and fire tangle in the heavens.
		Drawing that fleeting half-incense of dying sunlight into the inkpot,
		even icy rain catches fire like crimson twilight.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Twilight Blaze': within 1.5 hours around sunrise and sunset, all ink damage +18%,
		drops ignite 'Glowflame' for continuous burning,
		and the entire rain visual turns golden-orange.
		'''
	Burden: All ink damage reduced by 6% at noon and midnight
}

KikasaTalismanJi: {
	DisplayName: Clear Skies Talisman
	Tooltip: Holding umbrella gathers solar warmth, closing crashes down a searing ray of daylight; ink damage -8% while open
	Origin:
		'''
		After a tempest when dark clouds hang low, a golden rift suddenly cracks open in the cloud heart,
		pouring molten sunlight onto the earth with rolling heat.
		This talisman works in reverse: cold rain restrains solar fury while open;
		the instant the canopy folds shut, the clouds part and daylight crashes down like a pillar of fire.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Clearing': landing hits while open accumulates clear-sky vigor
		the instant the umbrella closes, clouds part to crash a searing beam of daylight
		at the cursor, damage scaling with charge.
		'''
	Burden: All ink damage reduced by 8% while the umbrella remains open
}

KikasaTalismanYu: {
	DisplayName: Rain Dance Talisman
	Tooltip: Continuous hits trigger the 'Great Rite' with torrential rain and geysers; regular ink damage -10% outside the rite
	Origin:
		'''
		In severe droughts when earth cracked for a thousand leagues, ancient shamans built three-tiered altars,
		beating alligator-skin drums with disheveled hair to offer umbrellas as vessels for rain.
		When the ritual count was complete, thunder exploded and black torrents cascaded like rivers overturned.
		This is the consummate scroll of rain-summoning: entering the Great Rite, deluges and geysers erupt as one.
		'''
	Power:
		'''
		'Great Rite': drop hits accumulate ritual points,
		full charge automatically entering a 10-second 'Great Rite':
		rain interval halved, drop damage +15%, all drops pool, geysers fully unlocked
		ending with three geysers erupting beneath the canopy.
		'''
	Burden: All ink damage reduced by 10% outside the Great Rite
}
